## No asigna.
weave print_build_help into void:
    calling spark.println with "Usage: psc build [TARGET] [options]"
    calling spark.println with "  TARGET                  .pengu file or project directory (default: cwd)"
    calling spark.println with "  --profile=debug|release"
    calling spark.println with "  --cc=NAME               C compiler (default: gcc/cc)"
